OL,3,GNEWSAOn-the-run killer who absconded
OL,4,Aafter father's funeral arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was convicted of murder and
OL,7,Fhas been unlawfully at large for over a
OL,8,Fweek has been arrested in the Republic
OL,9,Fof Ireland.
OL,11,FGary Anderson, 29, was jailed for life
OL,12,Fin 2023, alongside his brother, for the
OL,13,Fmurder of Karol Kelly in Londonderry.
OL,15,FHe was on temporary release from prison
OL,16,Fto attend his father's funeral when he
OL,17,Fabsconded.
OL,19,FHe was arrested on Wednesday by An
OL,20,FGarda Siochana (Irish police) at a
OL,21,Fproperty in the town of Buncrana in
OL,22,FCounty Donegal.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
